{
  "name": "bizuit",
  "description": "El paquete del stack de TYCON: .NET + React/Next.js sobre Bizuit. Las convenciones con que TYCON desarrolla plugins sobre Bizuit; no es un producto de Bizuit. Opcional y apagado por defecto: un repo de producto lo pide con `packs: [bizuit]` en su `.tycon/advisors.yaml`.",
  "guides": [
    "guides/bizuit/bizuit-plugin-dotnet.md",
    "guides/bizuit/bizuit-plugin-react.md",
    "guides/bizuit/bizuit-plugin-nextjs.md"
  ],
  "reviewers": [
    {
      "agent": "tycon-plugin-dotnet-conventions",
      "group": "base",
      "when": {
        "any": [
          { "detection": "csModified" },
          { "all": [ { "detection": "pluginCfgModified" }, { "no": { "detection": "tsxModified" } } ] }
        ]
      },
      "surface": { "paths": ["**/*.cs", "**/*.csproj", "**/plugin.json", "**/plugin.json.example"] },
      "depth": "standard",
      "prefixes": ["DOTNET"],
      "note": "La condición reproduce la matriz que el pipeline tenía escrita antes de la story 8.2, incluido su hueco: un diff .tsx + plugin.json no suma este revisor (la rama «sólo frontend» no miraba la config). Corregirlo es otra story; la equivalencia manda."
    },
    {
      "agent": "tycon-plugin-nextjs-conventions",
      "group": "base",
      "when": {
        "all": [
          { "detection": "hasNext" },
          { "any": [
            { "detection": "tsxModified" },
            { "all": [ { "detection": "depChanged" }, { "no": { "detection": "csModified" } } ] }
          ] }
        ]
      },
      "surface": { "paths": ["**/*.tsx", "**/*.ts"] },
      "depth": "standard",
      "prefixes": ["NEXT"]
    },
    {
      "agent": "tycon-plugin-react-conventions",
      "group": "base",
      "when": {
        "all": [
          { "detection": "hasReact" },
          { "no": { "detection": "hasNext" } },
          { "any": [
            { "detection": "tsxModified" },
            { "all": [ { "detection": "depChanged" }, { "no": { "detection": "csModified" } } ] }
          ] }
        ]
      },
      "surface": { "paths": ["**/*.tsx", "**/*.ts", "**/*.jsx", "**/*.js"] },
      "depth": "standard",
      "prefixes": ["REACT"]
    }
  ]
}
